Subject: Your {{communityName}} admin password has been reset
<h1>Your password has been reset</h1>
<p>An administrator reset the password for your {{communityName}} account. Sign in with the temporary password below — you will be asked to choose your own straight away.</p>
<table role="presentation" style="margin: 20px 0; width: 100%;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 14px 16px; background: #f4f4f5; border-radius: 8px;">
      <span class="muted" style="display: block; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase;">Username</span>
      <strong style="font-size: 16px;">{{username}}</strong>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td style="height: 8px;"></td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 14px 16px; background: #f4f4f5; border-radius: 8px;">
      <span class="muted" style="display: block; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase;">Temporary password</span>
      <strong style="font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: .02em;">{{temporaryPassword}}</strong>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p style="margin: 20px 0;"><a class="btn" href="{{signInUrl}}">Sign in</a></p>
<p class="muted">You were signed out on every device. This temporary password works once — you must set a new one at sign-in. If you did not expect this, contact your platform administrator immediately.</p>
